591
00:43:05.996 --> 00:43:06.930
Yeah.

592
00:43:09.266 --> 00:43:11.068
What the hell was
she doing out here?

593
00:43:13.202 --> 00:43:15.671
Poor thing.

594
00:43:21.343 --> 00:43:23.146
I have to sit down.

595
00:43:23.179 --> 00:43:24.847
I have to sit down.

596
