Let me the fuck out!

693
00:48:13.769 --> 00:48:15.371
Faris!

694
00:48:15.405 --> 00:48:17.507
Fuck you. Faris!
Open up!

695
00:48:18.907 --> 00:48:20.676
Open up the fucking door!

696
00:48:23.713 --> 00:48:25.515
Let me the fuck out!

697
00:48:29.718 --> 00:48:32.954
Let me out!
Faris. you fuck!

698
00:48:53.677 --> 00:48:54.911
Faris!

699
00:48:55.811 --> 00:48:57.179
