734
00:52:44.907 --> 00:52:46.276
I'll always
be with you.

735
00:52:47.642 --> 00:52:48.610
Light of my life.

736
00:52:48.644 --> 00:52:50.513
<i>Covenant.
do you read me?</i>

737
00:52:50.546 --> 00:52:52.248
My love. my angel.

738
00:52:52.280 --> 00:52:55.250
Lope. there's nothing
you can do.

739
00:52:57.086 --> 00:52:59.122
There's nothing. okay?

740
00:52:59.921 --> 00:53:01.724
