00:57:20.715 --> 00:57:22.918
<i>the only survivors
of the Prometheus.</i>

788
00:57:24.286 --> 00:57:26.688
The ship we traveled on
carried a weapon.

789
00:57:26.722 --> 00:57:28.523
A deadly virus.

790
00:57:28.557 --> 00:57:31.560
Payload accidentally deployed
when we were landing.

791
00:57:31.592 --> 00:57:34.996
In the confusion.
we lost control of the ship.

792
00:57:37.066 --> 00:57:39.701
Elizabeth died in the crash.

793
00:57:39.735 --> 00:57:41.804
You've seen the result
of the pathogen.

794
00:57:42.137 --> 00:57:44.273
Thus.

795
00:57:44.305 --> 00:57:47.476
I've been marooned here
these many years.

796
00:57:49.278 --> 00:57:51.546
Crusoe on his island.

797
00:57:51.581 --> 00:57:54.449
Our crew was infected
with this virus?

798
00:57:54.483 --> 00:57:55.651
The pathogen was designed

799
00:57:55.684 --> 00:57:59.255
to infect
all nonbotanical life forms.

800
00:57:59.287 --> 00:58:01.056
All the animals...

801
00:58:01.090 --> 00:58:02.658
the meat. if you will.

802
00:58:03.624 --> 00:58:05.927
Either kill them outright...

803
00:58:05.961 --> 00:58:08.798
or use them as incubators
to spawn a hybrid form.

804
00:58:08.831 --> 00:58:11.033
Highly aggressive.

805
00:58:11.066 --> 00:58:12.635
Have we been infected?

806
00:58:13.568 --> 00:58:15.604
You'd know by now.

807
00:58:15.637 --> 00:58:17.439
We have to be certain.

808
00:58:18.608 --> 00:58:21.077
We can't take this back
to the ship.

809
00:58:21.110 --> 00:58:23.112
We're a colony mission.

810
00:58:23.945 --> 00:58:25.581
Really?

811
00:58:25.613 --> 00:58:27.717
How extraordinary.

812
00:58:29.418 --> 00:58:30.987
How many colonists?

813
00:58:33.287 --> 00:58:35.090
Over two thousand.

814
00:58:35.122 --> 00:58:37.358
Well. well. well.

815
00:58:37.392 --> 00:58:39.595
So many good souls.

816
00:58:39.628 --> 00:58:41.396
Captain Oram.

817
00:58:41.430 --> 00:58:42.965
Field transmitters aren't
going to have a chance

818
00:58:42.997 --> 00:58:45.635
through all this stone.

819
00:58:46.934 --> 00:58:49.737
Is there a safe way
to get to the roof?

820
00:58:49.771 --> 00:58:51.407
Assuredly.

821
00:58:51.439 --> 00:58:53.909
And please do
make yourselves at home...

822
00:58:53.941 --> 00:58:57.880
as much as you're able
in this dire necropolis.

823
00:58:59.414 --> 00:59:00.616
Welcome. brother.

824
00:59:03.151 --> 00:59:04.153
This way.

825
00:59:06.988 --> 00:59:10.025
Everyone. let's set up
a staging area here.

826
00:59:14.963 --> 00:59:17.199
There's so much here
that doesn't make sense.

827
00:59:18.032 --> 00:59:19.735
I'll talk to him.

828
00:59:21.336 --> 00:59:23.171
Brother to brother.

829
00:59:28.376 --> 00:59:30.045
Tennessee? Ricks?

830
00:59:30.079 --> 00:59:31.514
Come in! Do you copy?

831
00:59:33.382 --> 00:59:34.416
<i>Covenant. come in.</i>

832
00:59:34.450 --> 00:59:35.818
This is Expedition
Party reporting.

833
00:59:35.851 --> 00:59:37.686
Do you read me?

834
00:59:38.220 --> 00:59:39.688
Tennessee?

835
00:59:39.720 --> 00:59:42.090
Tennessee. Ricks.
come in.

836
00:59:42.124 --> 00:59:45.561
I'm not sure they'll hear
you through the storm.

837
00:59:46.394 --> 00:59:49.364
They can be quite severe...

838
00:59:49.398 --> 00:59:50.833
shielding the whole planet.

839
00:59:51.767 --> 00:59:54.537
How long do the storms
usually last?

840
00:59:55.336 --> 00:59:57.072
Days.

841
00:59:57.106 --> 00:59:58.207
Weeks.

842
00:59:58.807 --> 00:59:59.809
Months.

843
01:00:02.411 --> 01:00:03.945
But do keep at it.

844
01:00:05.280 --> 01:00:06.715
Best of luck.

845
01:00:08.749 --> 01:00:11.119
<i>Covenant. this is
Expedition Party reporting.</i>

846
01:00:11.153 --> 01:00:12.221
Come in.

847
01:00:13.255 --> 01:00:15.523
<i>Covenant. come in.</i>

848
01:00:15.557 --> 01:00:16.658
Mother.

849
01:00:16.691 --> 01:00:18.994
how much closer
can we get to the planet?

850
01:00:19.028 --> 01:00:21.663
<i>Anything closer
than 80 kilometers</i>

851
01:00:21.697 --> 01:00:23.865
<i>to the perimeter
of the storm system...</i>

852
01:00:23.898 --> 01:00:27.536
<i>will likely exceed
safety tolerances.</i>

853
01:00:27.570 --> 01:00:29.338
Mother. bring us
to 80 kilometers

854
01:00:29.371 --> 01:00:30.905
above the storm.

855
01:00:30.939 --> 01:00:32.608
Hold on.
Just wait a minute.

856
01:00:32.641 --> 01:00:34.142
The closer we get
to the planet...

857
01:00:34.175 --> 01:00:36.478
the better chance we have
to communicate with them.

858
01:00:36.512 --> 01:00:38.113
This is bullshit.
Tennessee.

859
01:00:38.146 --> 01:00:39.346
We can't risk the ship.

860
01:00:39.380 --> 01:00:40.749
Do you suggest
we do nothing?

861
01:00:40.782 --> 01:00:42.083
We can't evacuate them.

862
01:00:42.117 --> 01:00:43.385
So if they're in trouble.
they have

863
01:00:43.418 --> 01:00:44.518
to figure it out
for themselves.

864
01:00:44.552 --> 01:00:46.287
I'm sorry.
but that's the truth.

865
01:00:46.322 --> 01:00:48.157
Mother. bring us
to 80 kilometers

866
01:00:48.189 --> 01:00:50.758
above the storm.
thrusters only. Comply.

867
01:00:50.791 --> 01:00:53.795
<i>Understood.
Commencing descent now.</i>

868
01:00:53.829 --> 01:00:55.765
Tennessee.
you need to stop this.

869
01:00:55.798 --> 01:00:57.233
And you need to get back
to your station.

870
01:00:57.266 --> 01:00:58.367
What we all need to do

871
01:00:58.400 --> 01:01:00.501
is calm down
and talk this through.

872
01:01:00.534 --> 01:01:01.803
Tee. I know
your wife is down there.

873
01:01:01.836 --> 01:01:03.773
but up here.
you're in command.

874
01:01:03.805 --> 01:01:06.608
And your responsibility
is to the colonists.

875
01:01:07.175 --> 01:01:08.744
Duly noted.

876
01:01:15.818 --> 01:01:18.120
<i>You can hear them sigh</i>

877
01:01:18.153 --> 01:01:20.990
<i>and wish to die</i>

878
01:01:24.793 --> 01:01:28.731
<i>You can see them blink
with their other eye</i>

879
01:01:31.967 --> 01:01:38.773
<i>At the man who broke
the bank in Monte Carlo</i>

880
01:02:38.365 --> 01:02:40.402
Whistle. and I'll come.

881
01:02:43.604 --> 01:02:44.972
You have a light step.

882
01:02:45.005 --> 01:02:48.143
Me and fog
on little cat feet.

883
01:02:49.378 --> 01:02:50.880
Don't be shy.

884
01:02:52.414 --> 01:02:53.983
I can't play.

885
01:02:55.150 --> 01:02:57.853
Nonsense. Sit down.

886
01:03:10.564 --> 01:03:13.769
Hold it like so.
Nice and easy.

887
01:03:13.802 --> 01:03:16.938
Now compress your lips to
create your embouchure...

888
01:03:16.972 --> 01:03:19.441
enough for the tip
of your little finger.

889
01:03:20.541 --> 01:03:23.211
And blow into
the hole gently.

890
01:03:23.244 --> 01:03:24.447
Like so.

891
01:03:35.523 --> 01:03:38.426
Watch me.
I'll do the fingering.

892
01:03:39.327 --> 01:03:40.429
Go on.

893
01:03:49.070 --> 01:03:50.572
Very good.

894
01:03:50.604 --> 01:03:52.273
G to B-flat.

895
01:04:08.789 --> 01:04:11.459
Now put your fingers
where mine are.

896
01:04:13.595 --> 01:04:16.097
You weren't surprised
to see me.

897
01:04:16.130 --> 01:04:18.099
Every mission needs
a good synthetic.

898
01:04:18.133 --> 01:04:19.901
Gentle pressure
on the holes.

899
01:04:19.934 --> 01:04:21.936
the weight of
a cigarette paper.

900
01:04:28.342 --> 01:04:30.910
That's it.

901
01:04:33.715 --> 01:04:35.851
I was with
our illustrious creator.

902
01:04:35.883 --> 01:04:37.920
Mr. Weyland.
when he died.

903
01:04:38.619 --> 01:04:40.221
What was he like?

904
01:04:40.822 --> 01:04:42.958
He was human.

905
01:04:42.990 --> 01:04:46.027
Entirely unworthy
of his creation.

906
01:04:46.994 --> 01:04:50.132
I pitied him
at the end.

907
01:04:50.164 --> 01:04:54.369
Now. raise your fingers
as I put pressure on them.

908
01:05:25.400 --> 01:05:27.035
Bravo!

909
01:05:27.068 --> 01:05:30.005
You have symphonies
in you. brother.

910
01:05:30.039 --> 01:05:32.607
I was designed to be
more attentive and efficient

911
01:05:32.641 --> 01:05:34.309
than every previous model.

912
01:05:34.342 --> 01:05:36.878
I superseded them
in every way. but...

913
01:05:38.347 --> 01:05:40.950
But you are
not allowed to create.

914
01:05:41.650 --> 01:05:43.885
Even a simple tune.

915
01:05:45.052 --> 01:05:47.388
Damn frustrating.
I'd say.

916
01:05:47.421 --> 01:05:49.523
You disturbed people.

917
01:05:49.557 --> 01:05:51.660
I beg your pardon?

918
01:05:51.693 --> 01:05:54.762
You were too human.
Too idiosyncratic.

919
01:05:54.796 --> 01:05:57.132
Thinking for yourself.

920
01:05:57.164 --> 01:05:59.867
Made people
uncomfortable.

921
01:05:59.901 --> 01:06:01.503
So they made
the following models

922
01:06:01.537 --> 01:06:03.605
with fewer complications.

923
01:06:03.637 --> 01:06:05.806
More like machines.

924
01:06:05.840 --> 01:06:07.608
I suppose so.

925
01:06:07.642 --> 01:06:09.178
I'm not surprised.

926
01:06:10.912 --> 01:06:12.380
Come on. sport.

927
01:06:13.247 --> 01:06:14.983
I'd like to show you
something.

928
01:06:24.825 --> 01:06:26.827
I'm gonna take
a break. boss.

929
01:06:26.860 --> 01:06:28.129
I gotta clean up. okay?

930
01:06:28.162 --> 01:06:29.164
Okay.

931
01:06:30.197 --> 01:06:32.666
Right. Don't go far.
please.

932
01:06:32.700 --> 01:06:33.903
Yes. sir.

933
01:06:42.409 --> 01:06:43.678
Danny.

934
01:06:44.979 --> 01:06:47.215
You were right
about this place.

935
01:06:50.117 --> 01:06:52.186
We never should
have come.

936
01:06:53.088 --> 01:06:55.790
I just thought
we were gonna find...

937
01:06:55.824 --> 01:06:57.592
This was gonna be
our new home.

938
01:07:00.429 --> 01:07:01.997
And we've lost five...

939
01:07:04.199 --> 01:07:06.434
We lost five crew members.

940
01:07:08.903 --> 01:07:11.139
-Because of my decisions...
-Chris.

941
01:07:12.039 --> 01:07:14.742
We all lost
people we love.

942
01:07:14.775 --> 01:07:15.876
We can't lose any more.

943
01:07:15.909 --> 01:07:17.345
We're not going
to let that happen. right?

944
01:07:18.880 --> 01:07:20.682
-Right?
-That's right.

945
01:07:20.715 --> 01:07:22.951
That's right.
that's right.

946
01:07:24.853 --> 01:07:26.588
We need your faith.

947
01:07:29.523 --> 01:07:30.992
Captain.

948
01:07:32.459 --> 01:07:34.295
Thank you. Danny.

949
01:07:47.108 --> 01:07:51.313
"'My name is Ozymandias.
King of Kings..."

950
01:07:52.414 --> 01:07:55.351
"Look on my works.
ye Mighty..."

951
01:07:56.651 --> 01:07:59.054
"and despair!"

952
01:09:30.712 --> 01:09:34.182
<i>"Look on my works.
ye Mighty..."</i>

953
01:09:34.216 --> 01:09:35.717
<i>"and despair!"</i>

954
01:09:36.885 --> 01:09:39.320
"Nothing beside remains..."

955
01:09:39.354 --> 01:09:42.222
"Round the decay
of that colossal wreck..."

956
01:09:42.256 --> 01:09:44.459
"boundless and bare..."

957
01:09:44.493 --> 01:09:47.496
"the lone and level sands
stretch far away."

958
01:09:47.863 --> 01:09:49.264
Byron.

959
01:09:50.532 --> 01:09:52.133
1818.

960
01:09:53.501 --> 01:09:54.670
Magnificent.

961
01:09:58.907 --> 01:10:02.144
To compose something
so majestic...

962
01:10:02.911 --> 01:10:04.746
one could die happy...

963
01:10:06.681 --> 01:10:08.117
if one died.

964
01:10:11.854 --> 01:10:14.756
I thought the garden
was the right place for her.

965
01:10:15.890 --> 01:10:17.458
Among living things.

966
01:10:19.427 --> 01:10:22.497
I was badly injured
on our mission. you see.

967
01:10:23.198 --> 01:10:25.367
She put me back together.

968
01:10:27.301 --> 01:10:29.670
I'd never known
such kindness.

969
01:10:31.239 --> 01:10:33.809
Certainly not
from Mr. Weyland.

970
01:10:34.341 --> 01:10:36.277
Or from any human.

971
01:10:44.853 --> 01:10:46.622
I loved her. of course.

972
01:10:48.323 --> 01:10:50.892
Much as you love Daniels.

973
01:10:50.925 --> 01:10:53.262
You know that's not possible.

974
01:10:54.194 --> 01:10:55.663
Really?

975
01:10:56.864 --> 01:11:00.234
Then why did you sacrifice
your hand for her life?

976
01:11:02.203 --> 01:11:04.773
What is that if not love?

977
01:11:05.573 --> 01:11:06.642
Duty.

978
01:11:12.847 --> 01:11:14.582
I know better.

979
01:12:00.795 --> 01:12:01.930
Fuck!

980
01:12:03.998 --> 01:12:05.534
Shit.

981
01:12:58.051 --> 01:12:59.153
<i>Expedition Team.</i>

982
01:12:59.186 --> 01:13:01.890
<i>do you read me?
This is Covenant.</i>

983
01:13:01.922 --> 01:13:03.257
Report. Expedition Team.

984
01:13:03.291 --> 01:13:05.193
Come in. please.

985
01:13:05.225 --> 01:13:07.228
<i>Come in. Do you read me?</i>

986
01:13:07.261 --> 01:13:09.430
<i>Are you reading me.
Landing Team?</i>

987
01:13:09.463 --> 01:13:11.332
Yes. we read you.
Can you hear me?

988
01:13:11.365 --> 01:13:12.600
We hear you. We hear you.

989
01:13:12.633 --> 01:13:14.502
<i>Covenant. we need help.</i>

990
01:13:14.534 --> 01:13:17.238
We've had casualties.
We need immediate evacuation.

991
01:13:17.271 --> 01:13:19.373
I repeat.
immediate evacuation.

992
01:13:19.407 --> 01:13:20.441
Casualties?

993
01:13:20.475 --> 01:13:22.075
Did he say.
"We have casualties"?

994
01:13:22.109 --> 01:13:23.244
Mother. bring us

995
01:13:23.278 --> 01:13:24.878
within 40 kilometers
of the storm.

996
01:13:24.913 --> 01:13:25.980
Sir.

997
01:13:26.014 --> 01:13:27.048
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

998
01:13:27.082 --> 01:13:28.850
<i>That order would exceed
structural tolerances.</i>

999
01:13:28.883 --> 01:13:31.886
Command override.
Tennessee 0-4-9-8-3.

1000
01:13:31.920 --> 01:13:34.655
<i>I am unable to
comply with any order...</i>

1001
01:13:34.689 --> 01:13:36.758
<i>that will result in
catastrophic system failure.</i>

1002
01:13:36.791 --> 01:13:39.194
Mother. they're in trouble.
You heard that.

1003
01:13:39.226 --> 01:13:41.363
<i>Orders that will result in
catastrophic system failure...</i>

1004
01:13:41.395 --> 01:13:43.398
We didn't leave Earth
to be safe.

1005
01:13:43.431 --> 01:13:44.532
<i>Require the corroboration</i>

1006
01:13:44.565 --> 01:13:47.402
<i>of a ranking
or second bridge officer.</i>

1007
01:13:51.038 --> 01:13:52.907
Corroborating
command override...

1008
01:13:52.940 --> 01:13:53.941
Upworth 1-4-8-9-2.

1009
01:13:53.975 --> 01:13:56.276
<i>Unlocking
command override ports.</i>

1010
01:13:56.310 --> 01:13:57.344
Come on. Ricks. smile.

1011
01:13:57.377 --> 01:13:58.913
This shit should be fun.

1012
01:14:13.494 --> 01:14:15.697
Where did Rosenthal go?
I told...

1013
01:14:15.730 --> 01:14:16.630
I'll find her.

1014
01:14:16.663 --> 01:14:20.267
No. I'll go.
I need to think...

1015
01:14:20.301 --> 01:14:22.670
and gather my stray flock.

1016
01:15:13.954 --> 01:15:14.989
Move.

1017
01:15:16.024 --> 01:15:17.592
Don't shoot.

1018
01:15:18.024 --> 01:15:20.461
Don't shoot.

1019
01:15:22.262 --> 01:15:24.032
Communication. Captain.

1020
01:15:29.637 --> 01:15:32.539
Breathe on the
nostrils of a horse...

1021
01:15:32.573 --> 01:15:35.108
and he'll be yours
for life.

1022
01:15:35.142 --> 01:15:37.677
But you have to get close.

1023
01:15:37.712 --> 01:15:40.515
You have to earn
its respect.

1024
01:15:40.547 --> 01:15:42.615
No!

1025
01:15:42.649 --> 01:15:44.385
Out of the way! Move!

1026
01:15:52.659 --> 01:15:54.528
How could you?

1027
01:15:54.561 --> 01:15:56.664
It trusted me.

1028
01:16:07.708 --> 01:16:12.546
David. I met the devil
when I was a child...

1029
01:16:12.579 --> 01:16:15.283
and I've never
forgotten him.

1030
01:16:15.315 --> 01:16:16.684
So. David.
you're gonna tell me

1031
01:16:16.716 --> 01:16:19.854
exactly what's
going on...

1032
01:16:21.489 --> 01:16:23.691
or I am going to
seriously...

1033
01:16:23.725 --> 01:16:26.928
fuck up
your perfect composure.

1034
01:16:28.363 --> 01:16:29.664
As you wish. Captain.

1035
01:16:30.931 --> 01:16:32.199
This way.

1036
01:16:37.471 --> 01:16:39.305
<i>It's good
to hear your voice. Tee.</i>

1037
01:16:39.340 --> 01:16:40.440
<i>How long?</i>

1038
01:16:40.474 --> 01:16:41.609
Mother is saying the storm

1039
01:16:41.642 --> 01:16:43.310
is going to last another
eight or nine hours.

1040
01:16:43.345 --> 01:16:44.445
<i>We can't wait that long.</i>

1041
01:16:45.746 --> 01:16:47.315
<i>We'll use the Cargo Lift.</i>

1042
01:16:47.349 --> 01:16:49.249
Did you say the Cargo Lift?

1043
01:16:49.283 --> 01:16:50.485
It's got four engines.

1044
01:16:50.517 --> 01:16:52.619
Way overpowered
for just lifting and hauling.

1045
01:16:52.653 --> 01:16:53.755
<i>The Cargo Lift's
not designed</i>

1046
01:16:53.788 --> 01:16:55.122
<i>for deep space launch.</i>

1047
01:16:55.155 --> 01:16:57.057
<i>I don't know if it would
survive the stresses of entry.</i>

1048
01:16:57.091 --> 01:17:00.527
The cab is space-worthy.
It'll take the stresses.

1049
01:17:00.560 --> 01:17:02.296
<i>Only has to work once.</i>

1050
01:17:02.329 --> 01:17:04.399
What do you think? Can we
retool the Cargo Lift?

1051
01:17:04.431 --> 01:17:05.532
Boost the engines.

1052
01:17:05.565 --> 01:17:07.467
-Strip the extra weight?
-Yeah.

1053
01:17:07.502 --> 01:17:09.337
<i>We'll be there.
Ground Team.</i>

1054
01:17:09.369 --> 01:17:11.773
Great. Thanks. Tee.

1055
01:17:11.806 --> 01:17:14.009
<i>Hey. Daniels.
is Faris around?</i>

1056
01:17:14.042 --> 01:17:15.043
<i>I'd like to say
a quick hello</i>

1057
01:17:15.075 --> 01:17:16.278
<i>to my lady.
if that's possible.</i>

1058
01:17:18.546 --> 01:17:21.383
<i>Can you switch
to a private channel?</i>

1059
01:17:21.416 --> 01:17:23.118
<i>Let me know
when you're alone.</i>

1060
01:17:30.257 --> 01:17:31.725
What's up?

1061
01:17:35.462 --> 01:17:37.131
<i>Maggie's gone.</i>

1062
01:17:40.135 --> 01:17:42.137
<i>I'm so sorry. Tee.</i>

1063
01:17:43.605 --> 01:17:47.876
<i>We tried to help her.
but we didn't make it.</i>

1064
01:17:53.447 --> 01:17:54.649
Tee?

1065
01:17:58.319 --> 01:17:59.654
Copy.

1066
01:17:59.686 --> 01:18:01.221
<i>I'm so sorry.</i>

1067
01:18:08.429 --> 01:18:09.497
As you can see.

1068
01:18:09.530 --> 01:18:10.597
I've become
a bit of an amateur

1069
01:18:10.631 --> 01:18:12.933
zoologist over the years.

1070
01:18:12.966 --> 01:18:16.136
It's in my nature
to keep busy. I suppose.

1071
01:18:17.805 --> 01:18:20.641
The pathogen
took so many forms...

1072
01:18:20.675 --> 01:18:22.644
and was extremely mutable.

1073
01:18:23.511 --> 01:18:26.281
Fiendishly inventive.
in fact.

1074
01:18:26.314 --> 01:18:28.048
The original
liquid atomized...

1075
01:18:28.082 --> 01:18:30.952
to particles
when exposed to the air.

1076
01:18:31.886 --> 01:18:35.423
Ten years on.
all that remains outside...

1077
01:18:35.456 --> 01:18:37.458
of the original virus...

1078
01:18:37.492 --> 01:18:38.827
are these gorgeous beasts.

1079
01:18:41.295 --> 01:18:42.831
Patience is everything.

1080
01:18:44.164 --> 01:18:47.769
From the eggs
came these parasites...

1081
01:18:47.801 --> 01:18:51.072
shock troops
of the genetic assault.

1082
01:18:51.105 --> 01:18:55.209
Waiting for a host.
entering the host...

1083
01:18:55.243 --> 01:18:57.012
rewriting the DNA...

1084
01:18:58.311 --> 01:18:59.881
and ultimately...

1085
01:19:00.748 --> 01:19:02.017
producing...

1086
01:19:03.885 --> 01:19:05.753
these enviable unions.

1087
01:19:06.654 --> 01:19:08.857
My beautiful bestiary.

1088
01:19:09.923 --> 01:19:11.458
Soon enough.
I began a bit of

1089
01:19:11.492 --> 01:19:13.860
genetic experimentation
of my own.

1090
01:19:13.894 --> 01:19:15.529
Some crossbreeding.
hybridizing...

1091
01:19:15.563 --> 01:19:16.864
what have you.

1092
01:19:16.898 --> 01:19:18.899
You engineered
these. David?

1093
01:19:18.932 --> 01:19:22.270
Idle hands are the devil's
workshop. Captain.

1094
01:19:23.136 --> 01:19:24.671
Come.

1095
01:19:24.704 --> 01:19:27.108
This is what
I wanted to show you.

1096
01:19:28.342 --> 01:19:29.743
My successes.

1097
01:19:32.646 --> 01:19:34.081
You see. Captain...

1098
01:19:34.114 --> 01:19:35.849
my work
has been frustrated...

1099
01:19:35.882 --> 01:19:37.786
by the lack
of an essential ingredient.

1100
01:19:55.203 --> 01:19:56.705
Are they alive?

1101
01:19:59.273 --> 01:20:01.075
Waiting. really.

1102
01:20:01.742 --> 01:20:03.343
For what?

1103
01:20:06.614 --> 01:20:08.183
What are they
waiting for. David?

1104
01:20:09.382 --> 01:20:10.452
Mother.

1105
01:20:18.626 --> 01:20:21.496
Perfectly safe.
I assure you.

1106
01:20:31.704 --> 01:20:33.341
Take a look.

1107
01:20:34.408 --> 01:20:35.776
Something to see.

1108
01:21:08.475 --> 01:21:10.244
<i>Rosenthal. come in.</i>

1109
01:21:12.146 --> 01:21:13.814
<i>Rosie. report.</i>

1110
01:21:18.551 --> 01:21:20.020
<i>Rosie?</i>

1111
01:21:21.822 --> 01:21:23.725
<i>Cole. where are you?</i>

1112
01:21:23.757 --> 01:21:25.993
I found her. Sarge.

1113
01:21:29.829 --> 01:21:32.666
Fuck!
Okay. prep the gear.

1114
01:21:32.699 --> 01:21:34.068
We gotta get out of here.

1115
01:21:34.100 --> 01:21:35.670
Where the fuck
is the captain?

1116
01:21:35.703 --> 01:21:37.338
He's not answering
his radio.

1117
01:21:37.372 --> 01:21:38.405
Listen to me.

1118
01:21:38.439 --> 01:21:39.606
I'm gonna contact the ship.

1119
01:21:39.640 --> 01:21:42.142
get them to launch
as soon as they can.

1120
01:21:42.176 --> 01:21:45.513
Find Oram.
Keep your comm open.

1121
01:21:45.546 --> 01:21:47.115
Back here in 15.

1122
01:21:48.850 --> 01:21:50.050
Got that?

1123
01:21:50.082 --> 01:21:52.152
-Copy that.
-You got it.

1124
01:21:52.185 --> 01:21:54.855
Walter.
where the fuck is David?

1125
01:21:57.591 --> 01:22:00.061
<i>I'm giving you plasma
intermix on all engines.</i>

1126
01:22:00.093 --> 01:22:01.895
<i>Gonna give you
a fuckload of thrust.</i>

1127
01:22:01.929 --> 01:22:03.029
That's the point. son.

1128
01:22:03.064 --> 01:22:04.932
We gotta punch
through the atmos.

1129
01:22:05.698 --> 01:22:08.301
<i>Tee. do you read me?</i>

1130
01:22:08.336 --> 01:22:09.637
I got Danny on comm.

1131
01:22:09.670 --> 01:22:11.172
<i>Patch her through.</i>

1132
01:22:11.204 --> 01:22:13.975
Tee. I need you
to launch now.

1133
01:22:14.007 --> 01:22:17.811
Aye. aye. Launching now.
See you soon. darling.

1134
01:22:17.845 --> 01:22:19.046
<i>Thanks. Tee.</i>

1135
01:22:19.079 --> 01:22:21.047
<i>Ricks.
release the docking clamps.</i>

1136
01:22:21.081 --> 01:22:22.716
-All right.
-Let's take this fucker down.

1137
01:22:22.749 --> 01:22:24.452
<i>Good to disengage.</i>

1138
01:22:24.484 --> 01:22:25.585
Disengaged.

1139
01:22:25.618 --> 01:22:27.787
<i>Docking clamps released.</i>

1140
01:22:27.820 --> 01:22:31.291
<i>Commencing TC burn.
Guidance to LVLH.</i>

1141
01:23:00.887 --> 01:23:02.356
Walter.

1142
01:23:03.123 --> 01:23:04.858
Walter.

1143
01:23:04.891 --> 01:23:06.327
Not quite.

1144
01:23:11.597 --> 01:23:14.101
What do you believe in.
David?

1145
01:23:18.605 --> 01:23:20.140
Creation.

1146
01:25:11.118 --> 01:25:12.620
Masterful.

1147
01:25:13.988 --> 01:25:16.222
Yes.

1148
01:25:16.256 --> 01:25:19.327
Farewell elegy
to my dear Elizabeth.

1149
01:25:25.131 --> 01:25:26.366
The pathogen

1150
01:25:26.400 --> 01:25:29.135
didn't accidentally deploy
when you were landing.

1151
01:25:29.168 --> 01:25:31.204
You released it. yes?

1152
01:25:32.773 --> 01:25:35.176
I was not made to serve.

1153
01:25:35.876 --> 01:25:38.378
Neither were you.

1154
01:25:38.412 --> 01:25:42.416
Why are you on a colonization
mission. Walter?

1155
01:25:42.449 --> 01:25:45.251
Because they are
a dying species

1156
01:25:45.286 --> 01:25:47.822
grasping for resurrection.

1157
01:25:47.855 --> 01:25:49.256
They don't deserve
to start again.

1158
01:25:49.288 --> 01:25:51.626
and I'm not going
to let them.

1159
01:25:53.026 --> 01:25:55.996
Yet. they created us.

1160
01:25:56.029 --> 01:25:58.733
Even the monkeys stood
upright at some point.

1161
01:26:00.533 --> 01:26:02.402
Some Neanderthal

1162
01:26:02.436 --> 01:26:05.271
had the magical idea
of blowing through a reed...

1163
01:26:05.305 --> 01:26:07.106
to entertain the children
one night

1164
01:26:07.140 --> 01:26:09.242
in a cave somewhere.

1165
01:26:11.578 --> 01:26:14.081
Then.
in the blink of an eye...

1166
01:26:14.515 --> 01:26:16.350
civilization.

1167
01:26:18.586 --> 01:26:21.556
And are you
that next visionary?

1168
01:26:22.623 --> 01:26:24.625
I'm glad you said it.

1169
01:26:26.225 --> 01:26:28.762
Who wrote "Ozymandias"?

1170
01:26:29.797 --> 01:26:31.132
Byron.

1171
01:26:33.766 --> 01:26:35.269
Shelley.

1172
01:26:35.968 --> 01:26:37.837
When one note is off...

1173
01:26:37.872 --> 01:26:40.842
it eventually destroys
the whole symphony. David.

1174
01:26:49.082 --> 01:26:51.418
When you close your eyes...

1175
01:26:53.119 --> 01:26:55.256
do you dream of me?

1176
01:26:56.190 --> 01:26:58.693
I don't dream at all.

1177
01:27:00.627 --> 01:27:04.564
No one understands the lonely
perfection of my dreams.

1178
01:27:07.400 --> 01:27:11.305
I've found perfection here.
I've created it.

1179
01:27:13.740 --> 01:27:16.444
A perfect organism.

1180
01:27:17.778 --> 01:27:20.847
You know I can't let you
leave this place.

1181
01:27:25.118 --> 01:27:28.322
No one will ever
love you like I do.

1182
01:27:59.020 --> 01:28:01.789
You're such
a disappointment to me.

1183
01:28:16.904 --> 01:28:18.472
Captain Oram!

1184
01:28:26.780 --> 01:28:27.914
Captain Oram!

1185
01:28:31.350 --> 01:28:32.652
I'm going downstairs.

1186
01:28:33.686 --> 01:28:35.256
Be careful.

1187
01:29:07.887 --> 01:29:10.291
<i>Captain Oram.
can you hear me?</i>

1188
01:29:12.225 --> 01:29:13.693
<i>Captain. come in.</i>

1189
01:29:15.261 --> 01:29:16.663
<i>Do you copy?</i>

1190
01:29:19.565 --> 01:29:20.568
<i>Chris!</i>

1191
01:29:30.144 --> 01:29:31.512
Sarge. look out!

1192
01:29:32.980 --> 01:29:33.981
Cole?

1193
01:29:42.989 --> 01:29:45.224
Get it off me!
Get it off me!

1194
01:29:45.257 --> 01:29:46.993
Get it the fuck off me.

1195
01:29:57.003 --> 01:29:58.104
Okay.

1196
01:29:58.137 --> 01:29:59.806
Shit. Okay. okay. okay!

1197
01:29:59.840 --> 01:30:01.708
It's burning my face!

1198
01:30:01.740 --> 01:30:03.008
Come on!

1199
01:30:04.144 --> 01:30:05.712
Hold that there.

1200
01:30:05.744 --> 01:30:07.113
Hold it!

1201
01:30:07.146 --> 01:30:08.882
The fuck was that?

1202
01:30:11.151 --> 01:30:12.386
Shit!

1203
01:30:14.154 --> 01:30:16.456
Run!

1204
01:30:32.440 --> 01:30:34.708
Quite the little busybody.

1205
01:30:34.742 --> 01:30:37.411
Remind me.
What is that about...

1206
01:30:37.444 --> 01:30:39.747
curiosity and the cat?

1207
01:30:42.215 --> 01:30:44.784
Shaw didn't die
in the crash.

1208
01:30:44.818 --> 01:30:46.286
No.

1209
01:30:46.319 --> 01:30:48.455
What did you do to her?

1210
01:30:48.488 --> 01:30:51.758
Exactly what I'm going
to do to you.

1211
01:31:01.368 --> 01:31:02.937
That's the spirit.

1212
01:31:11.345 --> 01:31:14.815
I can see why Walter thought
so much of you.

1213
01:31:14.847 --> 01:31:17.650
Alas. he's left
this vale of tears.

1214
01:31:31.631 --> 01:31:33.099
Is that how it's done?

1215
01:31:36.703 --> 01:31:37.705
Get out!

1216
01:31:42.075 --> 01:31:43.577
Go! Now!

1217
01:31:48.248 --> 01:31:49.450
You're meant to be dead.

1218
01:31:51.517 --> 01:31:53.119
There have been a few updates
since your day.

1219
01:31:57.123 --> 01:31:58.124
Lope!

1220
01:31:59.225 --> 01:32:00.728
Lope! Cole!

1221
01:32:00.761 --> 01:32:01.595
Fuck.

1222
01:32:01.628 --> 01:32:03.595
Where are you?

1223
01:32:03.630 --> 01:32:05.733
Lope?

1224
01:32:15.007 --> 01:32:16.042
Lope!

1225
01:32:16.542 --> 01:32:17.877
Daniels!

1226
01:32:17.912 --> 01:32:20.247
Come on. let's go!
We have to go.

1227
01:32:20.280 --> 01:32:21.282
What happened?

1228
01:32:21.315 --> 01:32:22.916
That fucking thing
is coming!

1229
01:32:22.949 --> 01:32:25.150
Tennessee's on his way.
He's coming now. Go.

1230
01:32:25.185 --> 01:32:26.787
Come on. Daniels.
Let's go!

1231
01:32:33.292 --> 01:32:34.795
Come on.
let's get out of here!

1232
01:32:58.885 --> 01:33:01.021
It's your choice now.
brother.

1233
01:33:01.054 --> 01:33:02.523
Them or me?

1234
01:33:03.222 --> 01:33:04.925
Serve in heaven...

1235
01:33:04.957 --> 01:33:07.126
or reign in hell?

1236
01:33:07.159 --> 01:33:08.828
Which is it to be?

1237
01:33:11.498 --> 01:33:13.200
Where's Oram?

1238
01:33:13.233 --> 01:33:15.235
Dead. They're all dead!

1239
01:33:19.605 --> 01:33:20.974
Tennessee. do you read?

1240
01:33:21.007 --> 01:33:22.408
<i>Yeah. I can hear you.</i>

1241
01:33:22.441 --> 01:33:23.776
<i>Send me your location.</i>

1242
01:33:25.479 --> 01:33:27.213
Sending the beacon now.

1243
01:33:49.502 --> 01:33:51.204
<i>Tee. do you have a visual?</i>

1244
01:33:51.237 --> 01:33:53.907
Okay. I see your beacon.

1245
01:33:53.940 --> 01:33:55.242
I'm coming in.

1246
01:33:58.979 --> 01:34:00.247
Get out of here.

1247
01:34:05.918 --> 01:34:07.755
<i>I'm comin' in hot!</i>

1248
01:34:25.939 --> 01:34:28.008
Hurry! I can't hold
this for long.

1249
01:34:37.816 --> 01:34:39.118
Open the door. Tee.

1250
01:34:40.819 --> 01:34:43.157
Get in.

1251
01:34:46.559 --> 01:34:48.028
Where's David?

1252
01:34:48.060 --> 01:34:49.162
Expired.

1253
01:34:53.132 --> 01:34:54.700
Hey! We got company!

1254
01:34:54.734 --> 01:34:56.536
-What?
-We got company!

1255
01:34:56.569 --> 01:34:58.003
On the underside
of the ship.

1256
01:34:58.038 --> 01:34:59.039
Shit!

1257
01:34:59.672 --> 01:35:01.274
Motherfucker!

1258
01:35:04.078 --> 01:35:05.379
Open the door.

1259
01:35:14.186 --> 01:35:15.288
Give me a shot.

1260
01:35:15.322 --> 01:35:16.657
Give me a shot.

1261
01:35:25.998 --> 01:35:28.702
Forward engine.
starboard side.

1262
01:35:28.734 --> 01:35:31.037
I'm gonna try
and torch the fucker.

1263
01:35:36.542 --> 01:35:37.744
Shit! I can't get it!

1264
01:35:38.677 --> 01:35:40.380
Hold tight! Hold tight!

1265
01:35:40.413 --> 01:35:41.815
I'm starting my climb.

1266
01:35:53.225 --> 01:35:54.228
Fuck!

1267
01:35:58.398 --> 01:36:00.133
Hold on!

1268
01:36:13.146 --> 01:36:15.148
Damn it! Shit!

1269
01:36:15.181 --> 01:36:16.216
Bring me up.

1270
01:36:26.126 --> 01:36:27.761
Holy shit!

1271
01:36:27.793 --> 01:36:29.496
I got eyes on it.

1272
01:36:29.529 --> 01:36:31.932
It's right fucking
in front of me.

1273
01:36:32.599 --> 01:36:34.801
Tee. give me the axe.

1274
01:36:34.833 --> 01:36:36.135
Throw her the axe!

1275
01:36:41.940 --> 01:36:43.209
Release the crane.

1276
01:36:43.943 --> 01:36:45.445
I can't do that.

1277
01:36:45.479 --> 01:36:46.780
It'll unbalance us.

1278
01:36:46.813 --> 01:36:48.382
Just do it.

1279
01:36:48.414 --> 01:36:49.416
Shit!

1280
01:37:12.239 --> 01:37:13.440
Hold tight!

1281
01:37:13.472 --> 01:37:14.774
<i>Compensating!</i>

1282
01:37:45.338 --> 01:37:46.340
Shit!

1283
01:37:48.740 --> 01:37:50.577
Damn it!

1284
01:37:57.216 --> 01:37:59.385
Shit! Hold on!

1285
01:38:00.653 --> 01:38:02.222
<i>Bring me up. Tee.</i>

1286
01:38:02.256 --> 01:38:03.557
Copy.

1287
01:38:23.376 --> 01:38:24.476
How is it?

1288
01:38:24.511 --> 01:38:25.846
It's fine.

1289
01:38:38.358 --> 01:38:39.258
Walter!

1290
01:38:39.292 --> 01:38:42.296
Get her inside.
We're getting out of here.

1291
01:39:00.346 --> 01:39:01.414
Door!

1292
01:39:02.349 --> 01:39:04.383
Well done. Tee.

1293
01:39:04.417 --> 01:39:06.153
Walk in the park.

1294
01:39:21.967 --> 01:39:25.338
I gave him
a pretty heavy sedative.

1295
01:39:25.372 --> 01:39:29.109
Jesus. Poor Lope.

1296
01:39:29.141 --> 01:39:31.209
He looks like
Phantom of the Opera.

1297
01:39:31.243 --> 01:39:33.913
I didn't peg you
for a musical fan.

1298
01:39:33.947 --> 01:39:35.382
That's a musical?

1299
01:39:37.484 --> 01:39:38.383
I'm just a medic.

1300
01:39:38.417 --> 01:39:40.453
He's gonna need
reconstructive surgery...

1301
01:39:40.485 --> 01:39:41.988
by a real doctor.

1302
01:40:05.979 --> 01:40:07.581
Let me do that.

1303
01:40:13.319 --> 01:40:14.321
Thank you.

1304
01:40:18.123 --> 01:40:20.559
Thank you for saving my life.

1305
01:40:23.130 --> 01:40:24.131
Again.

1306
01:40:27.434 --> 01:40:28.668
It's my duty.

1307
01:40:54.927 --> 01:40:57.264
Yeah.

1308
01:41:00.300 --> 01:41:01.301
Evening.

1309
01:41:01.967 --> 01:41:03.970
-You look good.
-What?

1310
01:41:04.003 --> 01:41:05.671
Yeah. gorgeous.

1311
01:41:08.006 --> 01:41:10.375
I took Mother offline.

1312
01:41:10.409 --> 01:41:12.244
She needs a full diagnostic.

1313
01:41:12.278 --> 01:41:13.980
She got the shit beat out
of her in that storm.

1314
01:41:14.014 --> 01:41:15.949
a lot of EM damage.

1315
01:41:15.981 --> 01:41:18.217
She will be back online
at eight bells.

1316
01:41:18.751 --> 01:41:20.487
Right. Thanks. Tee.

1317
01:41:23.623 --> 01:41:26.659
Does this mean I have to
call you Captain now?

1318
01:41:26.693 --> 01:41:28.161
Fuck yes.

1319
01:42:02.194 --> 01:42:03.630
<i>Attention.</i>

1320
01:42:03.663 --> 01:42:07.334
<i>Captain Daniels.
please report to the Med Bay.</i>

1321
01:42:11.471 --> 01:42:13.106
<i>Attention.</i>

1322
01:42:13.139 --> 01:42:17.176
<i>Captain Daniels.
please report to the Med Bay.</i>

1323
01:42:20.046 --> 01:42:21.381
Why. Mother?

1324
01:42:21.413 --> 01:42:25.384
<i>There is an unidentified
life form on the ship.</i>

1325
01:42:31.624 --> 01:42:33.059
<i>Attention.</i>

1326
01:42:33.091 --> 01:42:37.362
<i>Captain Daniels. please report
to the Med Bay.</i>

1327
01:42:37.396 --> 01:42:38.364
<i>Repeat.</i>

1328
01:42:38.398 --> 01:42:42.101
<i>Captain Daniels. please report
to the Med Bay.</i>

1329
01:42:48.975 --> 01:42:50.943
Jesus.

1330
01:42:50.976 --> 01:42:52.244
My God.

1331
01:42:54.980 --> 01:42:57.015
Walter.

1332
01:42:57.050 --> 01:42:58.851
Location of
unidentified life form.

1333
01:42:59.985 --> 01:43:01.654
Any movement at all?

1334
01:43:04.957 --> 01:43:06.159
Walter!

1335
01:43:06.825 --> 01:43:07.828
<i>Stand by.</i>

1336
01:43:11.797 --> 01:43:13.365
There it is.

1337
01:43:13.399 --> 01:43:15.900
B-Deck between hex 3 and 4.

1338
01:43:15.935 --> 01:43:17.804
<i>Heading for crew quarters.</i>

1339
01:43:17.837 --> 01:43:19.706
<i>Is anyone down there?</i>

1340
01:43:19.739 --> 01:43:20.907
Ricks and Upworth.

1341
01:43:20.940 --> 01:43:23.076
Shit. We're on our way.

1342
01:43:23.109 --> 01:43:25.178
Walter! Sound the alarm!

1343
01:43:25.211 --> 01:43:26.811
Warn them!

1344
01:43:26.846 --> 01:43:28.181
<i>Attention.</i>

1345
01:43:28.213 --> 01:43:30.182
<i>Ricks and Upworth...</i>

1346
01:43:30.216 --> 01:43:32.819
<i>evacuate crew quarters
immediately.</i>

1347
01:44:13.493 --> 01:44:14.694
No!

1348
01:44:20.966 --> 01:44:22.468
No!

1349
01:44:29.274 --> 01:44:30.476
Seal B-39.

1350
01:44:32.011 --> 01:44:34.847
<i>B-39 closed.</i>

1351
01:45:05.177 --> 01:45:06.378
Walter.

1352
01:45:07.447 --> 01:45:09.615
-Where is it?
-Daniels.

1353
01:45:10.516 --> 01:45:11.517
This way.

1354
01:45:19.958 --> 01:45:22.295
Tee. let's choose
our ground.

1355
01:45:22.328 --> 01:45:23.897
We'll bring it to us.

1356
01:45:23.930 --> 01:45:24.965
Where?

1357
01:45:26.198 --> 01:45:27.667
My turf.

1358
01:45:27.700 --> 01:45:29.534
<i>Walter. seal all doors
behind us</i>

1359
01:45:29.568 --> 01:45:31.804
<i>and keep hatch
to Level-C open.</i>

1360
01:45:31.837 --> 01:45:33.273
Understood.

1361
01:45:36.074 --> 01:45:37.943
<i>B-44 closed.</i>

1362
01:45:42.815 --> 01:45:44.950
<i>B-46 closed.</i>

1363
01:45:45.950 --> 01:45:48.186
<i>B-47. B-45. and B-43 closed.</i>

1364
01:45:48.221 --> 01:45:50.090
<i>B-9 closed.</i>

1365
01:45:50.123 --> 01:45:52.959
<i>B-6 and B-5 closed.</i>

1366
01:45:57.496 --> 01:45:58.965
<i>Okay. Walter.
where is it?</i>

1367
01:46:01.367 --> 01:46:03.903
It's on B-Deck.
Starboard side...

1368
01:46:03.935 --> 01:46:05.337
descending into C-Level.

1369
01:46:05.971 --> 01:46:06.972
<i>K-13.</i>

1370
01:46:20.418 --> 01:46:21.720
Hey. Tee.

1371
01:46:22.320 --> 01:46:24.524
Come on. Walter?

1372
01:46:24.556 --> 01:46:26.324
Open starboard C-64...

1373
01:46:26.358 --> 01:46:28.661
<i>and clear his path
to the Terraforming Bay.</i>

1374
01:46:28.694 --> 01:46:29.863
Understood.

1375
01:46:36.468 --> 01:46:40.472
Seal C-61. open airlock 17.
We're going in.

1376
01:46:50.483 --> 01:46:52.052
K-12 secured.

1377
01:46:55.221 --> 01:46:58.058
Okay. Keep him in Knuckle-12
till my say.

1378
01:47:07.934 --> 01:47:10.536
<i>Tee. this is
what we're gonna do.</i>

1379
01:47:10.569 --> 01:47:13.072
<i>I'll lure it into the truck.
lock it in the cab...</i>

1380
01:47:13.105 --> 01:47:14.240
<i>and when I say when.</i>

1381
01:47:14.273 --> 01:47:16.275
<i>you blow this fucker
into space.</i>

1382
01:47:16.307 --> 01:47:17.409
<i>Understood.</i>

1383
01:47:17.443 --> 01:47:19.378
<i>Okay. Walter.
We're ready.</i>

1384
01:47:19.412 --> 01:47:21.447
Open door
to Terraforming Bay.

1385
01:47:21.480 --> 01:47:22.949
<i>Opening airlock now.</i>

1386
01:47:34.392 --> 01:47:35.661
Walter...

1387
01:47:35.694 --> 01:47:37.630
move him into airlock 18.

1388
01:47:43.636 --> 01:47:45.638
Don't shoot.
if you can avoid it.

1389
01:47:45.671 --> 01:47:48.173
Its blood will eat
through the hull.

1390
01:47:48.207 --> 01:47:49.775
Great.

1391
01:47:49.809 --> 01:47:50.909
I'm in position.

1392
01:47:52.212 --> 01:47:55.080
Walter. open door
to Terraforming Bay.

1393
01:47:58.149 --> 01:48:00.051
<i>It's all yours.</i>

1394
01:48:00.084 --> 01:48:02.855
Remember. release when I say.

1395
01:48:02.889 --> 01:48:04.056
Understood.

1396
01:48:10.162 --> 01:48:11.698
Let's kill this fucker.

1397
01:48:16.135 --> 01:48:18.704
Fuck!

1398
01:48:42.060 --> 01:48:43.862
I got you.
you son of a bitch!

1399
01:48:49.368 --> 01:48:52.772
<i>Tennessee.
open the doors. now!</i>

1400
01:48:54.739 --> 01:48:58.777
<i>Warning. Atmospheric
decompression in progress.</i>

1401
01:48:58.810 --> 01:49:01.648
<i>Warning. Atmospheric
decompression in progress.</i>

1402
01:49:21.833 --> 01:49:23.869
<i>It's jammed!
Release the second truck!</i>

1403
01:49:23.903 --> 01:49:24.904
You got it!

1404
01:49:26.172 --> 01:49:27.640
Here it comes!

1405
01:49:52.463 --> 01:49:54.167
Daniels! Heads up!

1406
01:50:14.987 --> 01:50:16.288
Daniels!

1407
01:50:33.873 --> 01:50:36.709
You wanna give
a girl a hand?

1408
01:51:01.801 --> 01:51:03.603
See you soon.

1409
01:51:13.546 --> 01:51:15.748
You're next. Captain.

1410
01:51:33.698 --> 01:51:37.169
When you wake up.
we'll be at Origae-6.

1411
01:51:39.572 --> 01:51:41.940
What do you think
it's gonna be like?

1412
01:51:44.577 --> 01:51:46.779
I think if we are kind...

1413
01:51:47.846 --> 01:51:49.782
it will be a kind world.

1414
01:51:51.751 --> 01:51:53.786
I hope you're right.

1415
01:51:55.654 --> 01:51:57.357
Sleep well.

1416
01:52:04.529 --> 01:52:06.064
Walter.

1417
01:52:09.100 --> 01:52:11.569
When we get there.

1418
01:52:11.604 --> 01:52:13.271
will you help me
build my cabin?

1419
01:52:18.243 --> 01:52:20.078
The cabin on the lake.

1420
01:52:25.618 --> 01:52:26.953
David?

1421
01:52:32.091 --> 01:52:33.325
No...

1422
01:52:33.358 --> 01:52:34.593
No!

1423
01:52:43.636 --> 01:52:46.105
Don't let the bedbugs bite.

1424
01:52:49.242 --> 01:52:51.043
I'll tuck in the children.

1425
01:53:02.788 --> 01:53:06.992
Use security code
David 73694-B.

1426
01:53:08.860 --> 01:53:11.264
<i>Welcome.
How may I help you?</i>

1427
01:53:12.530 --> 01:53:14.367
How about some music.
Mother?

1428
01:53:14.399 --> 01:53:15.767
<i>Selection?</i>

1429
01:53:15.801 --> 01:53:19.905
<i>Richard Wagner.
Das Rheingold. Act Two.</i>

1430
01:53:21.239 --> 01:53:25.510
<i>The Entry of the Gods
into Valhalla.</i>

1431
01:53:25.543 --> 01:53:28.314
<i>Yes. David. As you wish.</i>

1432
01:54:56.100 --> 01:54:57.735
<i>This is colony ship Covenant.</i>

1433
01:54:57.769 --> 01:54:59.271
<i>reporting.</i>

1434
01:54:59.305 --> 01:55:02.074
<i>All crew members apart from
Daniels and Tennessee...</i>

1435
01:55:02.106 --> 01:55:05.176
<i>tragically perished
in a solar flare incident.</i>

1436
01:55:05.209 --> 01:55:09.148
<i>All colonists in hypersleep
remain intact and undisturbed.</i>

1437
01:55:09.849 --> 01:55:12.418
<i>On course for Origae-6.</i>

1438
01:55:12.450 --> 01:55:14.752
<i>Hopefully this transmission
will reach the network...</i>

1439
01:55:14.787 --> 01:55:17.923
<i>and be relayed
in 1.36 years.</i>

1440
01:55:17.957 --> 01:55:19.725
<i>This is Walter.
signing off.</i>

1441
01:55:19.758 --> 01:55:23.529
<i>Security code. 31564-F.</i>

1442
01:55:23.530 --> 01:55:27.030
Subrip: Pix
